{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Adjective","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"Relating to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/office\" title=\"office\">office</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bishop\" title=\"bishop\">bishop</a> or an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/archbishop\" title=\"archbishop\">archbishop</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":""},{"definition":"The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/principal\" title=\"principal\">principal</a> church serving as the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/office\" title=\"office\">office</a> (and some as place of residence) of an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/archdiocese\" title=\"archdiocese\">archdiocese</a>'s/a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/diocese\" title=\"diocese\">diocese</a>'s <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/archbishop\" title=\"archbishop\">archbishop</a>/<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bishop\" title=\"bishop\">bishop</a> which is symbolized by an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/episcopal\" title=\"episcopal\">episcopal</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/throne\" title=\"throne\">throne</a> known as the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cathedra\" title=\"cathedra\">cathedra</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The bishop presided over the ceremony from his seat in the <b>cathedral</b>."}],"examples":["The bishop presided over the ceremony from his seat in the <b>cathedral</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt39\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A large or important church building."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt40\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A large, impressive, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/lofty\" title=\"lofty\">lofty</a>, and/or important building or place of some other kind.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"a <b>cathedral</b> of commerce"}],"examples":["a <b>cathedral</b> of commerce"]},{"definition":"A large <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/buttressed\" title=\"buttressed\">buttressed</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/structure\" title=\"structure\">structure</a> built by certain <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/termite\" title=\"termite\">termites</a>."}]}],"other":[{"partOfSpeech":"Adjective","language":"Middle English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt213\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cathedral#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">cathedral</a></span> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt214\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt214\">relating to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/see#English\" title=\"see\">see</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bishop#English\" title=\"bishop\">bishop</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt214\">)</span>"}]}]}